OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain draws 10,000
OL,4,Avisitors to city
OL,5,
OL,6,FStage one of the men's Tour of Britain
OL,7,Fcycling race drew around 10,000
OL,8,Fvisitors to Lincoln, according to
OL,9,Fcouncil bosses.
OL,11,FThe stage started and finished in
OL,12,FLincoln on Wednesday before the race
OL,13,Fmoved on to Boston on Thursday for
OL,14,Fstage two, and Hull and East Yorkshire
OL,15,Ffor stage three.
OL,17,FNatalie Oliver from Lincolnshire County
OL,18,FCouncil said the event had been an
OL,19,F"incredible" occasion and put the
OL,20,Fcounty "on the map".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
