OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain draws 10,000
OL,4,Avisitors to city
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday the cyclists passed through
OL,7,FWithernsea, where Mayor Kristina
OL,8,FRichardson said the visitors had "a
OL,9,Fpositive impact" on local businesses.
